{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nThe day was warm and pleasant. We drove to Saint-Denis, where the cathedral still wore black for a recent funeral—a stark reminder of mortality even in the heart of France. From there to Montmorency, where I took a donkey to Rousseau’s Hermitage. The little beast was stubborn, but the climb to the heights was worth the effort. Looking back, one sees Paris stretching out, with Montmartre rising in the distance. It is a strange perspective to view the capital from such a rural vantage point. I confess I enjoyed the physical exertion more than the philosophical associations. The air is clear, and the light is fading beautifully over the Seine. I hope your health remains good in Berlin. I shall dine well tonight and sleep soundly.\n\nYour loving,\nGeorg"}}],"created":1795080582,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":171,"prompt_tokens":952,"total_tokens":1123,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-C37HCWscaeY5BDkzTqZr35tcufYzHwYj","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":952,"prompt_ms":991.09,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.041060924369748,"prompt_per_second":960.5585769203603,"predicted_n":171,"predicted_ms":4097.791,"predicted_per_token_ms":24.10465294117647,"predicted_per_second":41.48576635558036}}